{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yE4qSAmXzhrlR_bJ3owo6Q","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:26.931418+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yE4qSAmXzhrlR_bJ3owo6Q","html":"<div><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为促进全国各地优秀大学生之间的交流、</span></p><p><span>加深青年学生对公共卫生和疾病预防控制前沿</span></p><p><span>的<span>了解和认识，吸引优秀本科生报考，</span></span></p><p><span>我所拟举办2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动，</span></p><p><span>热忱欢迎有志于到我所深造的同学报名参加。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/HxxFqkCDVzabk7eblxKSmyx14246y5qicP1G1axHNojp1XlvKO4mhViapJyM7UQkF2GJx3OaeO8GnEajVzugyzrQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/HxxFqkCDVzabk7eblxKSmyx14246y5qicEYZ8O9JnUzUJ6dwtF5ic4GCHib5UqOwEOticNPM1lIYb2ibAt6X6hJ4rUw/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><section><strong>  一、招收对象与报名条件   </strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.2026年毕业的普通高校全日制在校本科生，且有意申请我所的2026年推荐免试研究生或第一志愿报考我所的2026年研究生。 </span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>2.品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康，学风端正，具有公共卫生、预防医学、基础医学、生物学、生命科学、临床医学等医学相关专业背景或相关交叉学科背景，对公共卫生和疾病预防控制有浓厚兴趣，有志于从事相关基础、基础应用或应用研究工作，具有较强或潜在的科研和创新能力。 </span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>3.学习成绩优秀，“双一流”高校学生截至目前总评成绩在本专业排名前50%、“所在学科教育部第四轮学科评估B+及以上”高校学生截至目前总评成绩在本专业排名前20%、普通类高校学生截至目前总评成绩在本专业排名前5%等优先。</span></p><p><br/></p><span>4.英语水平CET6≥425或TOEFL≥88或IELTS≥6.0。</span><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/HxxFqkCDVzabk7eblxKSmyx14246y5qicEYZ8O9JnUzUJ6dwtF5ic4GCHib5UqOwEOticNPM1lIYb2ibAt6X6hJ4rUw/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><section><strong>  二、时间安排   </strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.时间：2025年7月10日报到、7月11日活动、7月12日离营（如有变动另行通知）。 </span></p></section><p><br/></p></section></section><p><span>2.报名时间：即日起至2025年7月6日。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/HxxFqkCDVzabk7eblxKSmyx14246y5qicEYZ8O9JnUzUJ6dwtF5ic4GCHib5UqOwEOticNPM1lIYb2ibAt6X6hJ4rUw/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><section><strong>  三、活动内容   </strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>活动将以所内参观、专家讲座、师生自由交流、招生咨询等多种形式开展（具体活动安排及日程请以入选后正式通知为准）。</span></p><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/HxxFqkCDVzabk7eblxKSmyx14246y5qicEYZ8O9JnUzUJ6dwtF5ic4GCHib5UqOwEOticNPM1lIYb2ibAt6X6hJ4rUw/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><section><strong>  四、申请材料   </strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.《中国疾病预防控制中心寄生虫病预防控制所2025年大学生夏令营活动申请表》（扫描二维码下载，加盖公章）； </span></p></section></section><p><br/></p><p><span>2.本人有效期内的身份证与学生证（提交扫描件）； </span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>3.本科历年成绩单1份，并加盖院系教务部门公章(提交扫描件)； </span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>4.英语水平证书(提交扫描件)； </span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>5.其他可证明培养潜力和能力的材料：如在学术期刊上发表的文章、出版物或其他学术作品、专利、各类获奖证书等(提交扫描件)。</span></p><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/HxxFqkCDVzabk7eblxKSmyx14246y5qicEYZ8O9JnUzUJ6dwtF5ic4GCHib5UqOwEOticNPM1lIYb2ibAt6X6hJ4rUw/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><section><strong>  五、报名及入选事宜   </strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.以上所有材料电子版通过扫描方式处理，按照1-5的顺序生成一份pdf格式文件，于2025年7月6日前发送 liry@nipd.chinacdc.cn，逾期不再接收。邮件主题为: XX大学-XX专业-XX（姓名）。 邮件发出后请点击：https://www.wjx.cn/vm/Yif8V3t.aspx#问卷星链接进行报名信息登记。 </span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>2.我所将以申请者的教育背景、学业水平、科研能力、综合素质等作为主要评价依据，对申请者进行筛选，并于举办前邮件通知入选者。未接到邮件通知的同学即未入选，将不再另行通知。</span></p></section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/HxxFqkCDVzabk7eblxKSmyx14246y5qicEYZ8O9JnUzUJ6dwtF5ic4GCHib5UqOwEOticNPM1lIYb2ibAt6X6hJ4rUw/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><section><strong>  六、营员待遇   </strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.本次夏令营将根据营员表现评选出优秀营员，并为优秀营员颁发证书。 </span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>2.夏令营期间提供免费食宿，交通费用自理。正式录取为我所研究生者后（推免生以通过推免系统完成拟录取为准，统考生以一志愿复试录取为准）凭票报销往返路费（凭票实报实销至上海的高铁及动车二等座、普通列车硬座或硬卧、飞机经济舱）。 </span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>3.为入选营员统一购买活动期间的团体意外保险。</span></p></section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/HxxFqkCDVzabk7eblxKSmyx14246y5qicEYZ8O9JnUzUJ6dwtF5ic4GCHib5UqOwEOticNPM1lIYb2ibAt6X6hJ4rUw/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><section><strong>  七、注意事项   </strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.活动最新消息和相关信息可在所网站的通知公告栏目查询（网址：https://www.ipd.org.cn/；https://www.ipd.org.cn/bulletinc1.html）。 </span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>2.入选的学生参加活动时请带好本人学生证及身份证。 </span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>3.报到后须服从我所安排，全程参加我所夏令营活动。</span></p><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/HxxFqkCDVzabk7eblxKSmyx14246y5qicEYZ8O9JnUzUJ6dwtF5ic4GCHib5UqOwEOticNPM1lIYb2ibAt6X6hJ4rUw/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"undefined\"/></section><section><section><strong>  八、联系方式   </strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联 系 人：李老师、周老师 </span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>联系电话：021-64667407-107； </span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>电子邮箱：liry@nipd.chinacdc.cn。</span></p><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"夏令营活动申请表.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/TOVGwk1h5CD9sJo62waFhicPwJWBialCyjibWQaUKOsUkWn7qvBfQ8UG6kib8AJ2icw0B9VDLeDRqhcgEFxnjVc0INA/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mm